1
00:01:28,138 --> 00:01:33,366
[Adapted from Che Ye Liu Xiang's
novel of the same name]

2
00:01:33,366 --> 00:01:38,068
[Episode 8]

3
00:01:40,791 --> 00:01:42,541
You really don't make things
easy for your brother.

4
00:01:42,541 --> 00:01:45,333
I had a movie date with a girl this weekend.

5
00:01:45,333 --> 00:01:47,333
I didn't ask you to come.

6
00:01:47,333 --> 00:01:49,416
You don't know what's good for you.

7
00:01:49,416 --> 00:01:52,375
Do you know who that girl is?

8
00:01:52,375 --> 00:01:54,919
She's Director Ding's daughter.

9
00:01:55,541 --> 00:01:56,958
Deputy Director, right?

10
00:01:56,958 --> 00:01:58,708
From the Textile Bureau.

11
00:01:58,708 --> 00:02:00,375
I met him once at the Bei residence.

12
00:02:00,375 --> 00:02:02,708
Can't you wish for your brother's success?

13
00:02:02,708 --> 00:02:04,500
I'll become a full-time employee next month.

14
00:02:04,500 --> 00:02:07,083
Director Ding told me himself.

15
00:02:07,083 --> 00:02:08,791
When we're done eating,

16
00:02:08,791 --> 00:02:11,125
remember to get an invoice when you pay.

17
00:02:11,125 --> 00:02:13,510
List it as "promotional materials."

18
00:02:17,291 --> 00:02:20,625
Your dear brother... is not the same as before.

19
00:02:20,625 --> 00:02:24,445
When I go out now,
everyone is eager to flatter me.

20
00:02:28,791 --> 00:02:30,479
Do you know who this is?

21
00:02:34,166 --> 00:02:36,625
It'll shock you when I tell you.

22
00:02:36,625 --> 00:02:39,708
The business manager of Langjian Securities.

23
00:02:39,708 --> 00:02:41,000
Do you know Langjian?

24
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:43,208
Out of the top ten securities firms,

25
00:02:43,208 --> 00:02:45,541
Langjian accounts for more than half.

26
00:02:45,541 --> 00:02:47,875
Even Director Ding has to suck up to them.

27
00:02:47,875 --> 00:02:51,655
If they give you just a little tip,
you'll be rich.

28
00:02:53,583 --> 00:02:55,750
Bei's father may be a high official,

29
00:02:55,750 --> 00:02:58,000
but local connections matter more.

30
00:02:58,000 --> 00:03:00,583
If there's a way to make money...

31
00:03:00,583 --> 00:03:02,202
We have a benefactor this time.

32
00:03:04,791 --> 00:03:06,281
Xiao Fan.

33
00:03:07,541 --> 00:03:08,916
I was just thinking about you.

34
00:03:08,916 --> 00:03:11,625
I didn't expect to see you so soon.

35
00:03:11,625 --> 00:03:12,833
Oh, hello.

36
00:03:12,833 --> 00:03:15,890
I'm Xiao Fan's brother, Xiao Ping. And you?

37
00:03:17,500 --> 00:03:18,874
I'm Lu Tao.

38
00:03:18,874 --> 00:03:19,958
I've met your brother before.

39
00:03:19,958 --> 00:03:22,451
Oh, please have a seat.

40
00:03:25,708 --> 00:03:27,511
Lu Tao.

41
00:03:31,625 --> 00:03:33,056
Mr. Lu.

42
00:03:34,875 --> 00:03:36,131
Sit down.

43
00:03:39,833 --> 00:03:41,000
Xiao Fan.

44
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:42,916
Since you opened an account at my place,

45
00:03:42,916 --> 00:03:44,375
you haven't been back.

46
00:03:45,125 --> 00:03:47,993
I even had a VIP room prepared for you.

47
00:03:50,291 --> 00:03:52,916
I... don't have much capital.

48
00:03:53,708 --> 00:03:55,333
What's wrong?

49
00:03:55,333 --> 00:03:58,019
Does Lv Qing not trust me?

50
00:03:58,916 --> 00:04:00,208
Rest assured.

51
00:04:00,208 --> 00:04:02,916
Your capital is perfectly safe with me.

52
00:04:02,916 --> 00:04:05,999
Outsiders won't hear a single word.

53
00:04:07,541 --> 00:04:09,416
It has nothing to do with my brother.

54
00:04:09,416 --> 00:04:11,292
I just wanted to try it out myself,

55
00:04:11,292 --> 00:04:12,833
so I opened an account.

56
00:04:12,833 --> 00:04:15,570
There isn't even 10,000 yuan in it.

57
00:04:17,708 --> 00:04:19,291
Who is this?

58
00:04:19,291 --> 00:04:22,583
The General Manager
of Langjian Securities, Lu Tao.

59
00:04:22,583 --> 00:04:24,041
Mr. Lu.

60
00:04:24,041 --> 00:04:25,541
Oh, my!

61
00:04:25,541 --> 00:04:27,625
Please excuse my lack of manners.

62
00:04:27,625 --> 00:04:29,000
I'm so sorry.

63
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:31,333
Your name sounded so familiar just now,

64
00:04:31,333 --> 00:04:33,333
but I didn't realize it was you.

65
00:04:33,333 --> 00:04:35,958
Don't say that next time.

66
00:04:35,958 --> 00:04:38,041
We're all friends here.

67
00:04:38,041 --> 00:04:39,921
Yes, friends.

68
00:04:40,625 --> 00:04:44,375
Xiao Fan, whether it's your brother
or you in the game,

69
00:04:44,375 --> 00:04:46,541
since I've prepared this for you,

70
00:04:46,541 --> 00:04:49,583
just go ahead and use it.

71
00:04:49,583 --> 00:04:51,416
Funding is not an issue.

72
00:04:51,416 --> 00:04:52,708
Don't worry.

73
00:04:52,708 --> 00:04:55,550
If it's not enough, I'll cover it personally.

74
00:05:02,125 --> 00:05:04,625
Mr. Lu, that's really not necessary.

75
00:05:05,625 --> 00:05:07,500
What's wrong with you?

76
00:05:07,500 --> 00:05:10,135
Mr. Lu is being very kind.

77
00:05:10,135 --> 00:05:11,974
Whether you use it is one thing,

78
00:05:11,974 --> 00:05:13,166
but showing appreciation is another.

79
00:05:13,166 --> 00:05:15,072
Why are you so socially inept?

80
00:05:20,208 --> 00:05:24,083
Mr. Lu, I'll thank you on Xiao Fan's behalf.

81
00:05:24,083 --> 00:05:25,458
I'll let you two talk.

82
00:05:25,458 --> 00:05:28,166
I have something to do, so I'll head out.

83
00:05:28,166 --> 00:05:29,828
Wait, wait.

84
00:05:30,708 --> 00:05:32,749
I'll walk you out.

85
00:05:32,749 --> 00:05:34,489
Didn't I just say so?

86
00:05:35,749 --> 00:05:37,162
We're friends.

87
00:05:39,333 --> 00:05:40,666
Take care.

88
00:05:41,874 --> 00:05:43,653
Take care, Mr. Lu.

89
00:05:47,958 --> 00:05:50,124
Are you out of your mind?

90
00:05:50,124 --> 00:05:52,249
That's Lu Tao.

91
00:05:52,249 --> 00:05:53,499
He's willing to let you into the VIP room

92
00:05:53,499 --> 00:05:55,374
and even front you the money.

93
00:05:55,374 --> 00:05:57,791
It's all because of the Bei family's status.

94
00:05:57,791 --> 00:05:59,333
He's hand-picking you to get rich.

95
00:05:59,333 --> 00:06:02,166
He's practically handing you money!

96
00:06:02,166 --> 00:06:04,666
I'm about to divorce Bei Lv Xin.

97
00:06:04,666 --> 00:06:06,909
How can I use Mr. Bei's name like that?

98
00:06:07,749 --> 00:06:11,124
Besides, you can't offer him
anything in return,

99
00:06:11,124 --> 00:06:12,708
yet you want to take favors from him.

100
00:06:12,708 --> 00:06:14,166
That's not right.

101
00:06:14,166 --> 00:06:16,256
You're really something...

102
00:06:19,333 --> 00:06:20,708
Give me that tiny phone of yours.

103
00:06:20,708 --> 00:06:21,791
I need to make a call.

104
00:06:21,791 --> 00:06:23,481
- It's gone.
- What?

105
00:06:24,374 --> 00:06:26,968
You lost such a nice thing?

106
00:06:29,374 --> 00:06:30,672
I threw it out.

107
00:06:31,541 --> 00:06:33,016
I threw everything out.

108
00:06:39,458 --> 00:06:40,666
Xiao Fan.

109
00:06:40,666 --> 00:06:42,499
You don't need to come back once a week.

110
00:06:42,499 --> 00:06:44,333
Once a month is fine.

111
00:06:44,333 --> 00:06:47,249
Section Chief, that's against the rules.

112
00:06:47,249 --> 00:06:48,666
If you run into any trouble over there,

113
00:06:48,666 --> 00:06:49,833
just let me know.

114
00:06:49,833 --> 00:06:52,987
Technically, we are their superior unit.

115
00:06:54,541 --> 00:06:56,166
Thank you, Section Chief.

116
00:06:56,166 --> 00:06:58,124
It's nothing, Xiao Fan.

117
00:06:58,124 --> 00:07:00,333
Tell me the truth,

118
00:07:00,333 --> 00:07:02,833
it's not because we treated you poorly, right?

119
00:07:02,833 --> 00:07:04,374
It's really not, Section Chief.

120
00:07:04,374 --> 00:07:05,958
It's entirely...

121
00:07:05,958 --> 00:07:08,137
my own personal decision.

122
00:07:09,083 --> 00:07:10,499
All right.

123
00:07:10,499 --> 00:07:12,097
Then I'm relieved.

124
00:07:15,470 --> 00:07:18,585
[Train Station]

125
00:07:43,867 --> 00:07:45,706
<i>Hello?</i>

126
00:07:45,706 --> 00:07:49,014
<i>Xiao Fan, I'll be visiting Lin Gang next week.</i>

127
00:07:51,264 --> 00:07:53,457
<i>How is work going for you there?</i>

128
00:07:55,018 --> 00:07:56,998
<i>Everyone takes great care of me.</i>

129
00:07:56,998 --> 00:07:59,151
<i>How are your parents?</i>

130
00:08:00,657 --> 00:08:02,604
<i>They're getting by well.</i>

131
00:08:02,604 --> 00:08:04,683
<i>I'll be heading near your office.</i>

132
00:08:04,683 --> 00:08:06,459
<i>Let's grab a meal.</i>

133
00:08:08,601 --> 00:08:10,397
<i>Big Bro Lv Qing.</i>

134
00:08:11,221 --> 00:08:13,543
<i>How's Wen Xi?</i>

135
00:08:47,920 --> 00:08:51,507
[Train Station]

136
00:09:04,499 --> 00:09:05,749
Hello, Ms. Xu.

137
00:09:05,749 --> 00:09:07,499
I'm Lu Xiao Fan.

138
00:09:07,499 --> 00:09:10,046
- I'm...
- I know who you are.

139
00:09:20,958 --> 00:09:23,581
Hey, where did you go?
I've been waiting forever.

140
00:09:26,208 --> 00:09:28,306
I went to see Lu Tao today.

141
00:09:29,499 --> 00:09:30,958
What did you see him for?

142
00:09:30,958 --> 00:09:32,666
Lu Tao promised to let us in on a deal.

143
00:09:32,666 --> 00:09:35,351
He'll even put up 300,000 for our account.

144
00:09:35,999 --> 00:09:38,708
I'm not going. What if we lose money?

145
00:09:38,708 --> 00:09:39,916
He guaranteed it on the spot.

146
00:09:39,916 --> 00:09:42,333
Have you ever heard of
a casino owner losing money?

147
00:09:42,333 --> 00:09:43,791
Mr. Bei said...

148
00:09:43,791 --> 00:09:46,166
Securities are an investment, not gambling.

149
00:09:46,166 --> 00:09:47,166
Bullshit.

150
00:09:47,166 --> 00:09:48,624
In our case, it's just gambling.

151
00:09:48,624 --> 00:09:50,553
Are you stupid?

152
00:09:53,708 --> 00:09:55,458
Have you lost your mind?

153
00:09:55,458 --> 00:09:57,791
Others would beg for an opportunity like this.

154
00:09:57,791 --> 00:09:59,333
Did Lu Tao say...

155
00:09:59,333 --> 00:10:01,391
he'd only do it if I'm involved?

156
00:10:02,416 --> 00:10:04,666
Why would he share such a profitable business
instead of doing it himself?

157
00:10:04,666 --> 00:10:06,666
Why must he bring us along?

158
00:10:06,666 --> 00:10:08,666
He's trying to win over the Bei family.

159
00:10:08,666 --> 00:10:10,833
If you want to make this money,
go ahead yourself.

160
00:10:10,833 --> 00:10:12,166
Leave me out of it.

161
00:10:23,166 --> 00:10:25,083
You're new and not familiar with the work.

162
00:10:25,083 --> 00:10:26,930
I'll handle the communication.

163
00:10:28,499 --> 00:10:30,708
Let's see what the situation is.

164
00:10:30,708 --> 00:10:32,130
This part?

165
00:10:58,499 --> 00:10:59,749
Xiao Fan.

166
00:10:59,749 --> 00:11:02,291
What have you been busy with after work?

167
00:11:02,291 --> 00:11:05,576
I've had some family matters lately.

168
00:11:06,666 --> 00:11:07,833
Well...

169
00:11:07,833 --> 00:11:11,164
Have dinner with me this weekend.

170
00:11:14,041 --> 00:11:16,910
So, the rumors are true?

171
00:11:17,833 --> 00:11:19,166
Yes.

172
00:11:19,874 --> 00:11:21,374
I don't want to lie to you.

173
00:11:21,374 --> 00:11:24,249
So, you were never really married.

174
00:11:24,249 --> 00:11:25,499
No feelings...

175
00:11:25,499 --> 00:11:27,166
No married life.

176
00:11:28,374 --> 00:11:31,083
You're brave to decide to start a new life.

177
00:11:31,833 --> 00:11:33,457
Brave?

178
00:11:34,291 --> 00:11:37,184
That's the first time anyone's called me brave.

179
00:11:51,044 --> 00:11:52,336
<i>Fan Fan.</i>

180
00:11:53,999 --> 00:11:56,411
<i>Can we still be like we were before?</i>

181
00:11:58,291 --> 00:12:01,578
Your new life has just begun. No rush.

182
00:12:09,499 --> 00:12:11,166
Thank you for dinner tonight.

183
00:12:11,166 --> 00:12:13,576
See you tomorrow, Xiao Fan.

184
00:12:29,166 --> 00:12:31,463
This part still needs some changes.

185
00:12:32,124 --> 00:12:34,041
The caliber is about the same.

186
00:12:34,041 --> 00:12:36,083
So, we just need to modify this part...

187
00:12:36,083 --> 00:12:37,418
- And it'll be fine.
- Yes, no problem.

188
00:12:37,418 --> 00:12:39,065
That works.

189
00:12:39,065 --> 00:12:40,930
Let's do it this way.

190
00:12:43,333 --> 00:12:44,749
We'll start with this method first.

191
00:12:44,749 --> 00:12:47,462
I'll show it to you
once the revisions are done.

192
00:12:48,499 --> 00:12:49,791
Xiao Fan.

193
00:12:49,791 --> 00:12:51,166
Xiao Fan.

194
00:12:51,166 --> 00:12:52,749
Why are you running?

195
00:12:52,749 --> 00:12:55,166
Director Li, let's call it a day.

196
00:12:55,166 --> 00:12:56,499
I'm having dinner with my family.

197
00:12:56,499 --> 00:12:58,958
When you're free, let's have a proper drink.

198
00:12:58,958 --> 00:13:01,708
Hey, your brother.

199
00:13:01,708 --> 00:13:03,081
Big Bro.

200
00:13:06,333 --> 00:13:07,541
Lv Qing.

201
00:13:07,541 --> 00:13:10,041
Why is your family buying so much land?

202
00:13:10,041 --> 00:13:12,208
If you ask me, with that kind of money,

203
00:13:12,208 --> 00:13:15,958
we'd be better off playing big in stocks.

204
00:13:15,958 --> 00:13:18,499
You want to talk about Langjian, right?

205
00:13:18,499 --> 00:13:19,958
I'm really not interested lately.

206
00:13:19,958 --> 00:13:21,666
Think about it again.

207
00:13:21,666 --> 00:13:22,874
This one deal...

208
00:13:22,874 --> 00:13:26,583
could be worth more than
what we've made in years.

209
00:13:26,583 --> 00:13:28,041
You should be careful, too.

210
00:13:28,041 --> 00:13:30,025
Don't get yourself in trouble.

211
00:13:33,082 --> 00:13:34,124
Xiao Fan.

212
00:13:34,124 --> 00:13:36,524
It's rare for Lv Qing to visit Lin Gang.

213
00:13:36,524 --> 00:13:38,474
Let's go have dinner together.

214
00:13:41,166 --> 00:13:43,124
I have some business with a client.

215
00:13:43,124 --> 00:13:44,666
Which "important" client is this?

216
00:13:44,666 --> 00:13:45,708
Give me a name.

217
00:13:45,708 --> 00:13:48,631
Let me see which nobody
I'm supposed to care about.

218
00:13:51,291 --> 00:13:52,646
Forget it.

219
00:14:02,666 --> 00:14:03,791
Lu Xiao Fan.

220
00:14:03,791 --> 00:14:06,547
Do you really want to cut ties
with the Bei family?

221
00:14:09,458 --> 00:14:13,073
Lu Xiao Fan, don't tell me
you've suddenly grown a backbone.

222
00:14:14,041 --> 00:14:15,416
All these years, the Lu family...

223
00:14:15,416 --> 00:14:17,166
has enjoyed the status
of being the Bei family's in-laws.

224
00:14:17,166 --> 00:14:18,666
You've benefited plenty.

225
00:14:18,666 --> 00:14:20,374
If you lose that privilege,

226
00:14:20,374 --> 00:14:22,916
you won't just be going back to the past.

227
00:14:22,916 --> 00:14:24,624
It'll be like falling
from the top of this building...

228
00:14:24,624 --> 00:14:26,291
Splat! Right onto the ground.

229
00:14:26,291 --> 00:14:27,666
You'll be smashed to pieces.

230
00:14:27,666 --> 00:14:29,666
And people will even step on you.

231
00:14:29,666 --> 00:14:31,616
Think it over.

232
00:15:01,249 --> 00:15:02,916
<i>Lu Xiao Fan, what did you do?</i>

233
00:15:02,916 --> 00:15:04,166
<i>A girl came looking for you.</i>

234
00:15:04,166 --> 00:15:06,041
<i>She's been crying since she walked in.</i>

235
00:15:06,041 --> 00:15:08,041
What? Who is it?

236
00:15:08,041 --> 00:15:10,541
<i>Come here. I've got her on the line.</i>

237
00:15:10,541 --> 00:15:12,374
<i>Xiao Fan, where are you?</i>

238
00:15:12,374 --> 00:15:14,166
<i>It's Xiao Feng.</i>

239
00:15:14,166 --> 00:15:15,583
Xiao Feng?

240
00:15:15,583 --> 00:15:17,374
Why did you come all the way from home?

241
00:15:18,499 --> 00:15:20,583
Your brother, Lu Xiao Ping...

242
00:15:20,583 --> 00:15:23,499
He got me pregnant and ran away.

243
00:15:23,499 --> 00:15:25,583
I went to your house and begged your mom.

244
00:15:25,583 --> 00:15:27,999
But she wouldn't tell me where he was.

245
00:15:27,999 --> 00:15:29,583
I had no other choice.

246
00:15:29,583 --> 00:15:31,541
I sneaked into your house...

247
00:15:32,308 --> 00:15:35,499
and found this in the cupboard.

248
00:15:35,499 --> 00:15:36,611
That's how I found you.

249
00:15:36,611 --> 00:15:38,492
[Bank Transfer Notice]
[Lu Zhen Xing, Lu Xiao Fan]

250
00:15:39,342 --> 00:15:40,491
Xiao Fan.

251
00:15:40,491 --> 00:15:42,455
Lu Xiao Ping can't just ignore this.

252
00:15:42,455 --> 00:15:43,825
I understand.

253
00:15:43,825 --> 00:15:45,788
I'll get you something to eat first.

254
00:15:45,788 --> 00:15:47,655
Xiao Fan, please. I'm begging you.

255
00:15:47,655 --> 00:15:48,655
Help me.

256
00:15:48,655 --> 00:15:50,958
I'm begging you. You must help me find him.

257
00:15:50,958 --> 00:15:52,452
Xiao Feng, get up first.

258
00:15:52,452 --> 00:15:54,875
Look, you get some rest first.

259
00:15:54,875 --> 00:15:57,460
I'll... I'll think of something.

260
00:16:04,355 --> 00:16:06,120
What took you so long to answer?

261
00:16:06,120 --> 00:16:07,575
<i>Is Xiao Feng with you?</i>

262
00:16:07,575 --> 00:16:08,908
No.

263
00:16:08,908 --> 00:16:11,201
<i>Xiao Fan, can you do me a favor?</i>

264
00:16:11,201 --> 00:16:12,953
I can't help you with this.

265
00:16:12,953 --> 00:16:14,908
<i>Xiao Fan, I'm about to get engaged to Wei Wei.</i>

266
00:16:14,908 --> 00:16:17,065
<i>Everyone at the Bureau knows about it.</i>

267
00:16:17,065 --> 00:16:18,648
<i>My promotion is also at a critical stage.</i>

268
00:16:18,648 --> 00:16:21,024
<i>If she shows up now, it'll be the end of me!</i>

269
00:16:21,024 --> 00:16:23,540
Then why did you get her pregnant?

270
00:16:24,219 --> 00:16:26,174
<i>I didn't mean for it to happen.</i>

271
00:16:26,174 --> 00:16:28,580
<i>I just... I had too much to drink with friends.</i>

272
00:16:28,580 --> 00:16:30,540
<i>You know Xiao Feng has always idolized me.</i>

273
00:16:30,540 --> 00:16:34,315
<i>She was so persistent,
and I wasn't thinking clearly.</i>

274
00:16:34,315 --> 00:16:36,049
<i>How could I ever be with her?</i>

275
00:16:36,049 --> 00:16:39,030
<i>She didn't even finish middle school,
and I'm a college graduate.</i>

276
00:16:39,030 --> 00:16:41,261
<i>She's a farm girl,
while I'm on my way to great success.</i>

277
00:16:41,261 --> 00:16:42,574
<i>It's just not possible.</i>

278
00:16:42,574 --> 00:16:44,014
<i>That woman...</i>

279
00:16:44,014 --> 00:16:46,424
<i>Why doesn't she have any self-awareness?</i>

280
00:16:46,424 --> 00:16:48,614
Yes, she's a nobody.

281
00:16:48,614 --> 00:16:50,014
She's not good enough for you.

282
00:16:50,014 --> 00:16:52,253
But if you never intended
to spend your life with her,

283
00:16:52,253 --> 00:16:54,069
why did you give her hope?

284
00:16:54,069 --> 00:16:56,844
Why did you make her believe
you'd be with her forever?

285
00:16:56,844 --> 00:16:59,537
Lu Xiao Ping, you're a bastard.

286
00:17:05,530 --> 00:17:08,013
<i>Yes, yes, I'm a bastard.</i>

287
00:17:08,013 --> 00:17:09,038
<i>Xiao Fan.</i>

288
00:17:09,038 --> 00:17:11,271
<i>You have to save your brother
no matter what this time.</i>

289
00:17:11,271 --> 00:17:13,129
<i>Hurry and convince Xiao Feng
to get an abortion.</i>

290
00:17:13,129 --> 00:17:15,405
<i>I'll wire you the money for it right away.</i>

291
00:17:15,405 --> 00:17:16,846
<i>I'll give her some compensation, too.</i>

292
00:17:16,846 --> 00:17:19,288
Who cares about your compensation?

293
00:17:19,288 --> 00:17:21,729
You bastard! You son of a bitch!

294
00:17:21,729 --> 00:17:23,510
I'll never forgive you!

295
00:17:42,124 --> 00:17:43,999
Xiao Fan.

296
00:17:43,999 --> 00:17:45,374
Tell me...

297
00:17:45,374 --> 00:17:47,999
How can I get Ping Ping back?

298
00:17:47,999 --> 00:17:49,333
Xiao Feng.

299
00:17:49,333 --> 00:17:50,999
Calm down first.

300
00:17:50,999 --> 00:17:53,809
This matter can definitely be resolved.

301
00:17:55,541 --> 00:17:57,291
Then tell me...

302
00:17:57,291 --> 00:18:00,249
If he breaks up with that city girl,

303
00:18:00,249 --> 00:18:02,306
will he be with me?

304
00:18:12,124 --> 00:18:14,208
You should go back first, Xiao Fan.

305
00:18:14,208 --> 00:18:15,999
I want to rest.

306
00:18:15,999 --> 00:18:17,166
Xiao Feng.

307
00:18:17,166 --> 00:18:18,166
Don't worry.

308
00:18:18,166 --> 00:18:20,166
I'll definitely find a way.

309
00:18:20,166 --> 00:18:21,608
Get some sleep first.

310
00:18:21,608 --> 00:18:23,668
I'll come see you tomorrow morning.

311
00:18:41,374 --> 00:18:42,583
You've got the wrong person.

312
00:18:42,583 --> 00:18:44,083
I don't know you.

313
00:18:44,083 --> 00:18:46,166
You're Xiao Feng, right?

314
00:18:46,166 --> 00:18:49,041
If you want revenge on Xiao Ping, let me in.

315
00:18:49,041 --> 00:18:50,604
Let's talk.

316
00:18:56,999 --> 00:18:58,490
Xiao Feng.

317
00:19:01,874 --> 00:19:03,583
Hello.

318
00:19:03,583 --> 00:19:05,833
Where did the girl from Room 215 go?

319
00:19:05,833 --> 00:19:07,291
Room 215?

320
00:19:07,291 --> 00:19:08,499
Room 215...

321
00:19:08,499 --> 00:19:09,583
She checked out early this morning.

322
00:19:09,583 --> 00:19:12,499
She asked for directions to the Textile Bureau.

323
00:19:12,499 --> 00:19:14,588
- Thank you.
- No problem.

324
00:19:17,374 --> 00:19:20,708
I only inspect your unit once a year.
[Textile Bureau]

325
00:19:20,708 --> 00:19:23,414
You've really done us proud, Director Ding.

326
00:19:24,166 --> 00:19:25,333
Everyone, let's go inside.

327
00:19:25,333 --> 00:19:27,124
We can sit down and discuss this.

328
00:19:27,124 --> 00:19:29,414
You're on your own now.

329
00:19:32,083 --> 00:19:33,958
No need. You can go.

330
00:19:33,958 --> 00:19:35,499
I've already achieved my goal.

331
00:19:35,499 --> 00:19:37,833
- I won't trouble you anymore.
- Xiao Ping, what's wrong with you?

332
00:19:37,833 --> 00:19:39,245
Get in here!

333
00:19:49,166 --> 00:19:50,708
Xiao Feng.

334
00:19:50,708 --> 00:19:52,499
I'm sorry for the trouble.

335
00:19:52,499 --> 00:19:53,541
Xiao Feng.

336
00:19:53,541 --> 00:19:55,541
Let me help you get settled first.

337
00:19:55,541 --> 00:19:56,624
No need.

338
00:19:56,624 --> 00:19:57,999
I'm leaving now.

339
00:19:57,999 --> 00:19:59,166
Xiao Feng.

340
00:19:59,166 --> 00:20:00,963
Why go to such lengths?

341
00:20:01,749 --> 00:20:04,166
It doesn't matter if he doesn't love me.

342
00:20:04,166 --> 00:20:06,499
I want him to hate me for the rest of his life
whenever he thinks of me.

343
00:20:06,499 --> 00:20:07,958
I want his legs to tremble.

344
00:20:07,958 --> 00:20:09,591
I want him to remember this forever.

345
00:20:16,666 --> 00:20:17,874
He's the one who ruined me.

346
00:20:17,874 --> 00:20:19,458
He's the one who brought
Xiao Feng to cause trouble. It was him!

347
00:20:19,458 --> 00:20:21,532
How did it become me bringing her there?

348
00:20:22,458 --> 00:20:24,499
I had no idea she would go to your office.

349
00:20:24,499 --> 00:20:27,499
Then tell me, how did she find my office?

350
00:20:27,499 --> 00:20:29,249
Who else could have told her but you?

351
00:20:29,249 --> 00:20:31,333
You're useless and divorcing the Beis,

352
00:20:31,333 --> 00:20:33,499
so you can't stand to see me
marry a director's daughter, right?

353
00:20:33,499 --> 00:20:35,833
You made Xiao Feng come on purpose, didn't you?

354
00:20:35,833 --> 00:20:38,208
You're blaming others for your own failures.

355
00:20:38,208 --> 00:20:40,166
How many times have I told you?

356
00:20:40,166 --> 00:20:42,833
Stop messing around
with that girl. Did you listen?

357
00:20:42,833 --> 00:20:44,666
Mom, I'm ruined. I have nothing left.

358
00:20:44,666 --> 00:20:46,666
My job, my marriage... it's all gone.

359
00:20:46,666 --> 00:20:47,916
My life is ruined, Mom!

360
00:20:47,916 --> 00:20:49,249
You deserve it.

361
00:20:49,249 --> 00:20:51,433
Who else can you blame for your failures?

362
00:20:52,291 --> 00:20:55,749
But regarding this matter,
Xiao Fan is also to blame.

363
00:20:55,749 --> 00:20:57,874
That Xiao Feng found your office...

364
00:20:57,874 --> 00:20:59,999
How could you be so careless

365
00:20:59,999 --> 00:21:01,583
as to let her know where he worked?

366
00:21:01,583 --> 00:21:04,333
Aren't you sabotaging your own family?

367
00:21:04,333 --> 00:21:05,333
Stop it.

368
00:21:05,333 --> 00:21:06,791
How is this Xiao Fan's fault?

369
00:21:06,791 --> 00:21:09,431
We've caused Xiao Fan enough trouble already.

370
00:21:11,458 --> 00:21:13,958
Blame Xiao Ping for being so disappointing.

371
00:21:13,958 --> 00:21:15,765
It's just our bad luck.

372
00:21:18,874 --> 00:21:20,294
Xiao Fan.

373
00:21:20,999 --> 00:21:24,083
Let your brother stay with you for a while.

374
00:21:24,083 --> 00:21:26,333
Just until he finds a job.

375
00:21:26,333 --> 00:21:30,249
Mom, you know my qualifications aren't enough.

376
00:21:30,249 --> 00:21:31,541
And I've only worked in the public sector.

377
00:21:31,541 --> 00:21:33,470
Where am I going to find a job?

378
00:21:35,958 --> 00:21:37,416
Xiao Fan.

379
00:21:37,416 --> 00:21:39,666
Are you still in touch with the Bei family?

380
00:21:39,666 --> 00:21:41,115
No.

381
00:21:42,666 --> 00:21:45,066
Don't you have Bei Lv Qing's number?

382
00:21:49,999 --> 00:21:51,041
You're so useless.

383
00:21:51,041 --> 00:21:52,999
You're such a disappointment.

384
00:21:53,916 --> 00:21:56,539
Can you bear to see your brother like this?

385
00:22:03,541 --> 00:22:04,999
I'll try.

386
00:22:19,708 --> 00:22:21,085
<i>Hello?</i>

387
00:22:22,458 --> 00:22:23,905
<i>Who is it?</i>

388
00:22:26,541 --> 00:22:27,958
<i>Who are you?</i>

389
00:22:27,958 --> 00:22:28,999
It's...

390
00:22:28,999 --> 00:22:30,374
It's me.

391
00:22:30,374 --> 00:22:32,001
Lu Xiao Fan.

392
00:22:35,166 --> 00:22:37,666
I asked the other day, but you were busy.

393
00:22:37,666 --> 00:22:41,874
I wanted to ask,
are you free these next few days?

394
00:22:41,874 --> 00:22:43,150
<i>I'm busy.</i>

395
00:22:58,333 --> 00:22:59,666
Mom.

396
00:22:59,666 --> 00:23:01,499
Dad should be home by now, right?

397
00:23:01,499 --> 00:23:02,666
He should be.

398
00:23:02,666 --> 00:23:04,666
Three days by train and one day by bus.

399
00:23:04,666 --> 00:23:06,787
He'll call you when he arrives.

400
00:23:08,416 --> 00:23:09,622
Mom.

401
00:23:10,833 --> 00:23:12,166
You still have to work.

402
00:23:12,166 --> 00:23:13,208
I don't eat much at home.

403
00:23:13,208 --> 00:23:14,484
It's okay.

404
00:23:17,166 --> 00:23:18,541
Mom.

405
00:23:18,541 --> 00:23:20,083
This rice has gone sour.

406
00:23:20,083 --> 00:23:22,249
I know. Just a little bit.

407
00:23:22,249 --> 00:23:24,583
I've rinsed it with hot water a few times.

408
00:23:24,583 --> 00:23:26,708
There's no well water here.
We can't keep things fresh for long.

409
00:23:26,708 --> 00:23:27,791
But you'll get diarrhea.

410
00:23:27,791 --> 00:23:29,474
I'm not that fragile.

411
00:23:30,499 --> 00:23:32,249
I'm going out to eat.
Lu Xiao Fan, do you have any money?

412
00:23:32,249 --> 00:23:33,250
Yes.

413
00:23:33,250 --> 00:23:35,249
Give me some money. I'm going for noodles.

414
00:23:35,249 --> 00:23:36,676
Don't you have your own money?

415
00:23:37,833 --> 00:23:39,698
I don't have a job. Where would I get it?

416
00:23:41,666 --> 00:23:44,291
You don't need that much for a bowl of noodles.

417
00:23:44,291 --> 00:23:45,627
It's fine.

418
00:23:53,708 --> 00:23:55,041
Mom.

419
00:23:55,041 --> 00:23:56,548
What's wrong?

420
00:24:05,999 --> 00:24:07,083
Nothing.

421
00:24:07,083 --> 00:24:08,546
Let's eat.

422
00:24:15,541 --> 00:24:17,502
It's because of my brother, isn't it?

423
00:24:20,666 --> 00:24:22,070
Fan Fan.

424
00:24:23,291 --> 00:24:24,900
It's not that...

425
00:24:27,875 --> 00:24:29,851
It's not that I want to give you a hard time.

426
00:24:30,666 --> 00:24:31,958
I'm just afraid...

427
00:24:31,958 --> 00:24:34,708
that if your brother doesn't find a real job,

428
00:24:34,708 --> 00:24:36,916
he'll be ruined.

429
00:24:39,874 --> 00:24:41,308
Mom.

430
00:24:44,708 --> 00:24:46,985
I'll try asking the Bei family again.

431
00:24:48,249 --> 00:24:49,961
Don't worry.

432
00:24:50,874 --> 00:24:52,472
If that doesn't work,

433
00:24:53,249 --> 00:24:55,166
I'll wait for Mr. Bei to return.

434
00:25:15,291 --> 00:25:16,833
<i>I'm Wu from the Textile Bureau.</i>

435
00:25:16,833 --> 00:25:18,499
<i>Tonight at 8:00.</i>

436
00:25:18,499 --> 00:25:20,583
<i>If you're busy, don't bother coming.</i>

437
00:25:20,583 --> 00:25:21,977
Okay.

438
00:25:38,041 --> 00:25:40,900
What a rare guest! Xiao Fan, sit down!

439
00:25:49,249 --> 00:25:50,477
Big Bro.

440
00:25:51,833 --> 00:25:53,833
What's the matter?

441
00:25:53,833 --> 00:25:57,499
It's... It's about my brother.

442
00:25:57,499 --> 00:26:00,166
Your brother? Your brother is doing very well.

443
00:26:00,166 --> 00:26:02,166
People who want his help...

444
00:26:02,166 --> 00:26:05,624
have to wait months just to see him.

445
00:26:05,624 --> 00:26:07,916
No, not Bei Lv Qing.

446
00:26:07,916 --> 00:26:09,374
It's my older brother.

447
00:26:09,374 --> 00:26:12,074
He... He lost his job.

448
00:26:13,041 --> 00:26:14,041
Oh.

449
00:26:14,041 --> 00:26:15,958
You mean that brother of yours...

450
00:26:15,958 --> 00:26:18,083
who got a girl pregnant...

451
00:26:18,083 --> 00:26:20,415
and then tried to ditch her?

452
00:26:21,333 --> 00:26:24,041
He knows he was wrong.

453
00:26:24,874 --> 00:26:27,624
Lu Xiao Fan, the moment you show up,

454
00:26:27,624 --> 00:26:29,249
you give us such a difficult problem.

455
00:26:29,249 --> 00:26:30,666
Finding a job...

456
00:26:30,666 --> 00:26:31,666
is a piece of cake.

457
00:26:31,666 --> 00:26:32,666
It's a small matter.

458
00:26:32,666 --> 00:26:35,999
But with such a scoundrel in your family,

459
00:26:35,999 --> 00:26:37,916
decent people can't avoid him fast enough.

460
00:26:37,916 --> 00:26:41,166
Who'd want to step in that pile of crap?

461
00:26:41,166 --> 00:26:42,583
I'm sorry. I'm really sorry.

462
00:26:42,583 --> 00:26:44,184
I'll be going now.

463
00:26:53,999 --> 00:26:55,954
Remove the roe for me.

464
00:26:57,333 --> 00:26:58,566
Okay.

465
00:26:59,874 --> 00:27:00,999
Look at you.

466
00:27:00,999 --> 00:27:02,666
You've got quite a temper.

467
00:27:02,666 --> 00:27:03,708
Today, I...

468
00:27:03,708 --> 00:27:05,666
specially ordered two sea urchin sashimi.

469
00:27:05,666 --> 00:27:08,021
They were ordered just for you.

470
00:27:08,708 --> 00:27:09,916
You've made such a scene.

471
00:27:09,916 --> 00:27:11,966
Is it over after two sea urchins?

472
00:27:15,499 --> 00:27:17,916
I'm just being righteous,
and can't stand a heartless man.

473
00:27:17,916 --> 00:27:19,124
Who knew it would be such a coincidence?

474
00:27:19,124 --> 00:27:21,541
So, this heartless man
happened to be Xiao Fan's brother?

475
00:27:21,541 --> 00:27:24,958
Xiao Fan, I won't hide it from you.

476
00:27:24,958 --> 00:27:27,583
The woman your brother messed with
went to the Municipal Committee yesterday.

477
00:27:27,583 --> 00:27:29,749
I just happened to run into her.

478
00:27:29,749 --> 00:27:32,749
I told her the mayor
was visiting the Textile Bureau.

479
00:27:33,458 --> 00:27:36,098
You won't hold a grudge against me, will you?

480
00:27:38,958 --> 00:27:41,499
No. It was his own fault.

481
00:27:42,249 --> 00:27:43,583
What did I tell you?

482
00:27:43,583 --> 00:27:45,499
That's the best thing about Xiao Fan.

483
00:27:45,499 --> 00:27:48,249
He's reasonable and knows how to behave.

484
00:27:48,249 --> 00:27:50,374
I knew he wouldn't get angry.

485
00:27:50,374 --> 00:27:53,639
If he got angry,
he'd be treating me like a stranger.

486
00:27:56,083 --> 00:27:57,749
Hello, what would you like to order?

487
00:27:57,749 --> 00:27:59,041
Give me another round of these two dishes.

488
00:27:59,041 --> 00:28:00,160
Certainly.

489
00:28:00,999 --> 00:28:04,333
Why did you order so much sushi and tempura?

490
00:28:04,333 --> 00:28:06,749
Just to make you spend a little more.

491
00:28:06,749 --> 00:28:08,598
Hey, you...

492
00:28:14,666 --> 00:28:16,574
Go buy me a pack of cigarettes.

493
00:28:25,374 --> 00:28:27,566
What's wrong, Young Master?

494
00:28:29,333 --> 00:28:31,958
You didn't just happen to meet Xiao Feng
at the Municipal Committee, did you?

495
00:28:32,874 --> 00:28:35,583
I was just trying to create
an opportunity for you and Lu Xiao Fan.

496
00:28:35,583 --> 00:28:37,333
Hey. Look at you.

497
00:28:37,333 --> 00:28:39,541
Since Lu Xiao Fan left,

498
00:28:39,541 --> 00:28:41,874
when have you ever smiled as much as today?

499
00:28:41,874 --> 00:28:44,749
Then you'll handle Xiao Ping's job.

500
00:28:44,749 --> 00:28:45,958
Fine, fine, fine.

501
00:28:45,958 --> 00:28:47,666
When is it not me who arranges things?

502
00:28:47,666 --> 00:28:50,166
No need for you to even ask, Lord Bei.

503
00:28:50,166 --> 00:28:53,291
Also, without my permission in the future,

504
00:28:53,291 --> 00:28:56,026
don't do anything to harm the Lu family.

505
00:29:09,749 --> 00:29:11,446
Pack it up and take it back.

506
00:29:12,333 --> 00:29:14,416
Big Bro, there's no need.

507
00:29:16,499 --> 00:29:19,458
Why didn't I notice you loved smiling so much?

508
00:29:19,458 --> 00:29:20,749
All right, Lord Bei.

509
00:29:20,749 --> 00:29:21,749
My bad.

510
00:29:21,749 --> 00:29:23,518
I shouldn't have laughed.

511
00:29:25,083 --> 00:29:26,291
How about this?

512
00:29:26,291 --> 00:29:27,749
I'll follow today's menu

513
00:29:27,749 --> 00:29:29,041
and pack an identical set to go.

514
00:29:29,041 --> 00:29:30,541
I'll have it delivered to Xiao Fan's house.

515
00:29:30,541 --> 00:29:31,583
Will that do?

516
00:29:31,583 --> 00:29:32,999
That's all?

517
00:29:32,999 --> 00:29:34,041
Oh, right.

518
00:29:34,041 --> 00:29:38,499
As for Xiao Ping's job, I'll take care of it.

519
00:29:41,458 --> 00:29:42,458
Xiao Fan.

520
00:29:42,458 --> 00:29:44,124
Why don't you thank Zi Yang?

521
00:29:44,124 --> 00:29:45,208
Thank you, Zi Yang.

522
00:29:45,208 --> 00:29:46,541
Oh, Xiao Fan.

523
00:29:46,541 --> 00:29:48,958
You're making me feel too important.

524
00:29:48,958 --> 00:29:51,166
It's no big deal. Why are you being so formal?

525
00:29:51,166 --> 00:29:52,458
Waiter!

526
00:29:52,458 --> 00:29:55,458
Pack another set of these dishes.

527
00:29:55,458 --> 00:29:57,583
Zi Yang, please don't order more.

528
00:29:57,583 --> 00:29:59,124
I can't carry that much home.

529
00:29:59,124 --> 00:30:00,666
Home?

530
00:30:00,666 --> 00:30:03,470
You think you're going home tonight?

531
00:30:13,958 --> 00:30:15,583
Xiao Fan.

532
00:30:15,583 --> 00:30:18,100
Let me give you some heartfelt advice.

533
00:30:20,083 --> 00:30:21,708
See that?

534
00:30:21,708 --> 00:30:24,041
The kind of life you get to live,

535
00:30:24,041 --> 00:30:26,708
depends entirely on that man's mood.

536
00:30:26,708 --> 00:30:28,333
Don't think too highly of yourself,

537
00:30:28,333 --> 00:30:30,583
and don't think you're that important.

538
00:30:30,583 --> 00:30:34,333
Having a backer like Lv Qing
is truly your good fortune.

539
00:30:34,333 --> 00:30:35,666
You left yesterday,

540
00:30:35,666 --> 00:30:36,916
yet you could still come back today.

541
00:30:36,916 --> 00:30:39,833
But one day, if you leave,
you might not be able to return.

542
00:30:39,833 --> 00:30:42,583
To put it bluntly,

543
00:30:42,583 --> 00:30:43,916
there are plenty of men better than you,

544
00:30:43,916 --> 00:30:46,499
and even more women.

545
00:30:47,333 --> 00:30:49,041
All right, I'm off.

546
00:30:49,041 --> 00:30:50,624
Thank you, Zi Yang.

547
00:30:58,041 --> 00:30:59,874
What nonsense was Lin Zi Yang spouting?

548
00:31:01,208 --> 00:31:02,686
Nothing.

549
00:31:06,749 --> 00:31:08,124
Don't worry.

550
00:31:08,124 --> 00:31:10,874
Lin Zi Yang can certainly handle
finding a job for your brother.

551
00:31:11,708 --> 00:31:13,568
I... I understand.

552
00:31:20,124 --> 00:31:21,581
Let's go.

